{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on realism, physics, and competitive play</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC DISC GOLF - MADE FOR DISC GOLFERS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Disc Golf with a true-to-life physics simulation focused on realistic flight paths, skips, rollers, and wind interaction. Every throw is affected by angle, speed, nose angle, and disc characteristics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVER 300 REAL DISCS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your bag from 300+ real world discs, each with unique flight behavior, stability, and feel. Find your favorites or experiment with new ones, and master shot shaping just like in real disc golf.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.poster.avif?t=1772649095\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.webm?t=1772649095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/d115341eb3821759bc6366ece99a4917.mp4?t=1772649095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>6 COURSES TO PLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play full courses with varying difficulty. Choose a single hole, 3-hole practice rounds, front or back 9, or full 18-hole rounds. Train specific shots, improve consistency, and develop your game through dedicated training and skill challenges designed to help you lower your score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.poster.avif?t=1772649095\" width=590 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.webm?t=1772649095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/extras/a5fcb51cb144c54f7001c3017e5c9b94.mp4?t=1772649095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE &amp; LOCAL MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross-platform online play against friends or ranked opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in ranked matches and improve your rating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u20134 player local multiplayer for couch play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play casually or competitively</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILT FOR PRECISION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with controller or mouse &amp; keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for accuracy, consistency, and skill-based gameplay</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SOLO DEVELOPER PROJECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a disc golf player, this game focuses on realism and features that matter on the course - built with care over years of iteration and feedback from players.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2721210?t=1772649095","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2721210?t=1772649095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/ee5a33089af70ca6189d43c0d0c7962ed6b9eb17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772649095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721210/ee5a330